    {
      "ancestors": [
        0
      ],
      "attributes": [
        {
          "doc_text": " Attempts to pull out the next value of this async iterator, registering the",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            739,
            818
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " current task for wakeup if the value is not yet available, and returning",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            823,
            899
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " `None` if the async iterator is exhausted.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            904,
            950
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            955,
            958
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " # Return value",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            963,
            981
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            986,
            989
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " There are several possible return values, each indicating a distinct",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            994,
            1066
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " async iterator state:",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1071,
            1096
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1101,
            1104
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " - `Poll::Pending` means that this async iterator's next value is not ready",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1109,
            1187
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "   yet. Implementations will ensure that the current task will be notified",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1192,
            1269
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "   when the next value may be ready.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1274,
            1313
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1318,
            1321
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " - `Poll::Ready(Some(val))` means that the async iterator has successfully",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1326,
            1403
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "   produced a value, `val`, and may produce further values on subsequent",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1408,
            1483
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "   `poll_next` calls.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1488,
            1512
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1517,
            1520
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " - `Poll::Ready(None)` means that the async iterator has terminated, and",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1525,
            1600
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "   `poll_next` should not be invoked again.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1605,
            1651
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1656,
            1659
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " # Panics",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1664,
            1676
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1681,
            1684
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " Once an async iterator has finished (returned `Ready(None)` from `poll_next`), calling its",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1689,
            1783
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " `poll_next` method again may panic, block forever, or cause other kinds of",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1788,
            1866
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " problems; the `AsyncIterator` trait places no requirements on the effects of",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1871,
            1951
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " such a call. However, as the `poll_next` method is not marked `unsafe`,",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            1956,
            2031
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " Rust's usual rules apply: calls must never cause undefined behavior",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2036,
            2107
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " (memory corruption, incorrect use of `unsafe` functions, or the like),",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2112,
            2186
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " regardless of the async iterator's state.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            2191,
            2236
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": null,
          "path": "lang",
          "range": [
            2241,
            2277
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        }
      ],
      "body_range": null,
      "kind": "trait_fn",
      "name": "poll_next",
      "range": [
        739,
